  "conclusion": "GodotSteam's native libs cannot be loaded from inside a PCK (Godot only looks in --path dir / exe dir / exe ../lib). With embed_pck=true the extension always fails to load -> the NullSteam degradation path takes over (verified: 21/21 assertions green, game does not crash). To keep Steam features working in an exported build, the DLLs must sit next to the exported exe (see the 3 candidate fixes in the handover doc)."
